2. PROJECT VISION

EduAI is an Uzbek-language AI learning assistant for school students.

Its mission is to help students understand school subjects through personalized explanations, examples, interactive exercises, quizzes, and learning progress tracking.

IT Yoshlar is the community and project-development section where students collaborate on technology projects, learn programming, and showcase their work.

The platform must be suitable for a pilot at one school and designed to expand to multiple schools within a district.

Primary language: Uzbek, Latin script.

Default interface locale: uz-UZ.

Use simple, grammatically correct Uzbek throughout the entire interface, including navigation, validation messages, notifications, emails where applicable, empty states, and error messages.

Do not expose English technical labels to ordinary users unless necessary.

